{"resourceIdentifier":"5310","resourceName":"Ankang Hanbin Landfill Gas Power Generation Project","description":"Ankang Hanbin Landfill Gas Power Generation Project (hereafter referred to as “the project”) is a landfill gas (LFG) recovery and utilization project is located next to Yangpigou Landfill at Hanbin District, Ankang City, Shaanxi Province, People’s Republic of China. \r\nThe purpose of the project is to collect LFG from Yangpigou Landfill and utilize it for power generation; a flare system destroys LFG when the power generators are out of operation or under maintenance . The project started construction in 2021. Three power generators of 1.067 MW each, which add up to 3.201 MW, have been installed, and they were put into operation on 03-April-2023.\r\nThe project achieves emission reductions in two aspects: 1) it avoids methane emissions by capturing and destroying LFG which would have been directly vented into the atmosphere in the baseline scenario; 2) it reduces CO2 emissions by displacing part of the electricity that would otherwise have been supplied by the fossil-fuel-dominated NWCPG.","location":{"latitude":32.729683,"longitude":109.012810},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2024-11-06","endExclusive":"2024-12-07","endInclusive":"2024-12-06"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"5310"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Shaanxi"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Ankang Xinzhongshui Environmental Protection Technology Co., Ltd."},{"type":"string","value":"Shaanxi Province, China"},{"type":"string","value":"+86 021-23019950"},{"type":"string","value":"3542346576@qq.com"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"72891"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY